{"id":"n50393-5-5","stage":4,"title":"때우다 · 打发","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n50393-5-5-1","ko":"이 게임 재미있나 봐?","zh":"这个游戏看起来挺有意思的吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게임","meaning":"游戏，比赛","explanation":"게임：游戏，比赛","readings":[{"term":"게임","audio":"/audio/252ac990d27ebe080959.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57276","senseId":"1","lemma":"게임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"재미있나","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐?","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"252ac990d27ebe08","term":"게임","zh":"游戏，比赛","audio":"/audio/252ac990d27ebe080959.mp3","entryId":"57276","definition":"制定规则、分出胜负的玩法。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5af4ee85584f200161d7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n50393-5-5-2","ko":"아니, 그냥 시간이나 때우려고 하는 거지.","zh":"不，我只是想打发